WEBVTT

01
00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.494
Before paying
The wallet holds AED 1500.00 and the ledger has no payment yet.

02
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:19.322
The review
Both fines, the exact total and the wallet as the source. Nothing has moved yet.

03
00:00:19.639 --> 00:00:22.652
Authorized
The wallet holds AED 420.00 for this payment. It is reserved, not spent.

04
00:00:23.104 --> 00:00:31.116
The receipt
One payment of AED 420.00 in the ledger, the hold released, both fines paid at the agency.
